MODIFICATIONS:

All Facebook SDK dependencies and code have been removed from iOS and Android.

Modified files:
- Package.swift: Removed facebook-ios-sdk dependency
- CapgoCapacitorSocialLogin.podspec: Removed FBSDKCoreKit and FBSDKLoginKit dependencies, Alamofire preserved for Apple Sign-In
- android/build.gradle: Removed facebook-login dependency, removed includeFacebook ext variable, removed Twitter dependency variables, always use facebookDisabled source set
- android/gradle.properties: Generated by configure-dependencies.js with Apple and Google enabled, Facebook disabled
- ios/Sources/SocialLoginPlugin/FacebookProvider.swift: Replaced with stub that rejects all calls
- ios/Sources/SocialLoginPlugin/SocialLoginPlugin.swift: Removed conditional Facebook imports, always uses stub FacebookProvider
- package.json: Stripped devDependencies, removed build scripts, removed facebookEnabled from files list, removed twitter and facebook from keywords
- android/src/facebookEnabled/: Deleted directory entirely

Google Sign-In and Apple Sign-In functionality preserved unchanged.

This fork is maintained internally for the Roach Coach application and removes
Facebook login capabilities as requested by the application owner.

